et=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+5 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +5 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Haste_Guard\" title=\"Haste Guard\">Haste&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Haste_Guard\" title=\"Haste Guard\">Haste&#32;Guard</a>:</b> When you are hit by enemies, there is a chance you will be Hasted, quickening your attack and movement speed.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor-Piercing\" title=\"Armor-Piercing\"> Armor-Piercing 10%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor-Piercing\" title=\"Armor-Piercing\"> Armor-Piercing 10%</a>:</b> Passive: +10% <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a> Bypass. (Fortification Bypass makes your attacks ignore a percentage of enemy Fortification.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Relentless_Fury\" title=\"Relentless Fury\">Relentless Fury</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Relentless_Fury\" title=\"Relentless Fury\">Relentless Fury</a></b>: While this item is equipped, any killing blows you strike against enemies may drive you into a furious rage, providing a 5% Enhancement damage bonus to your melee, ranged and unarmed attacks for 30 seconds. Slaying weaker opponents has a reduced chance of producing this effect.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Acid_Resistance\" title=\"Acid Resistance\">Acid Resistance +30</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Acid_Resistance\" title=\"Acid Resistance\">Acid Resistance +30</a>:</b> Passive: +30 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to your Acid Resistance.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Black_Dragonscale_Docent.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Black_Dragonscale_Docent.png/420px-Black_Dragonscale_Docent.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"545\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Black_Dragonscale_Docent.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>This docent was crafted with the scales of black dragon.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n<p>Pre-Update 14 version were not retroactively updated and have to be reacquire for Update 14 enchantments.\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201104\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.103 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.153 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3392/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25455/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7899/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n109.55%  141.510     46 Template:IO\n100.00%  129.170      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  129.170      1 -total\n 96.94%  125.211      1 Template:Named_Armor\n 37.81%   48.844      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 36.49%   47.137      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 34.42%   44.463      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 33.33%   43.054      2 Template:InCategory\n 27.75%   35.847      7 Template:Popup\n 19.69%   25.440      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12875-0!canonical and timestamp